tus":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-yangxiu:p003:m0002","kind":"person","surface":"劉毅","start":138,"end":140,"person_id":"fcn_avk_8w3","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-yangxiu:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-yangxiu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-jin093-yangxiu-liuyi-sili","person_id":"fcn_avk_8w3","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-ws1548000-yangxiu","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-yangxiu","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-yangxiu:p003","quote":"琇性豪侈，費用無復齊限，而屑炭和作獸形以溫酒，洛下豪貴咸競效之。又喜游燕，以夜續晝，中外五親無男女之別，時人譏之。然黨慕勝己，其所推舉，便盡心無二。窮窘之徒，特能振恤。選用多以得意者居先，不盡銓次之理。將士有冒官位者，為其致節，不惜軀命。然放恣犯法，每為有司所貸。其後司隸校尉劉毅劾之，應至重刑，武帝以舊恩，直免官而已。尋以侯白衣領護軍。頃之，復職。及齊王攸出鎮也，琇以切諫忤旨，左遷太僕。既失寵憤怨，遂發病，以疾篤求退。拜特進，加散騎常侍，還第，卒。帝手詔曰：「琇與朕有先後之親，少小之恩，歷位外內，忠允茂著。不幸早薨，朕甚悼之。其追贈輔國大將軍、開府儀同三司，賜東園秘器，朝服一襲，錢三十萬，布百匹。」諡曰威。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-yangxiu:p003:m0002"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"interpretation_note":"彈劾者劉毅的官，非羊琇。","fixed_source_fact_binding":{"kind":"fixed_witness_person_fact_slots","key":"jin093-yangxiu","slot":"liuyi-sili"},"title":"司隸校尉","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","appointment_role":"attestation","source_career_role":{"kind":"fixed_witness_person_fact_slots","key":"jin093-yangxiu","slot":"liuyi-sili"},"attestations":[{"id":"th-jin093-yangxiu-liuyi-sili:a001","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-yangxiu:p003","start":134,"end":138,"surface":"司隸校尉","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-yangxiu:p003:m0002","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}}}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007","text":"戎在職雖無殊能，而庶績修理。後遷光祿勳、吏部尚書，以母憂去職。性至孝，不拘禮制，飲酒食肉，或觀弈棋，而容貌毀悴，杖然後起。裴頠往吊之，謂人曰：「若使一慟能傷人，濬沖不免滅性之譏也。」時和嶠亦居父喪，以禮法自持，量米而食，哀毀不逾於戎。帝謂劉毅曰：「和嶠毀頓過禮，使人憂之。」毅曰：「嶠雖寢苫食粥，乃生孝耳。至於王戎，所謂死孝，陛下當先憂之。」戎先有吐疾，居喪增甚。帝遣醫療之，並賜藥物，又斷賓客。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"s6r_kug_pk7","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"裴頠","kind":"person","person_id":"svm_6fh_34r","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"濬沖","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"和嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"3fc_362_06e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"父","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"和嶠父未名，本來源尚未與其他父名交證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p